---
// Appel à orienter un jeune : contacts de la direction.

---

  <section class="alt-section alt-cta" id="orienter">
    <div class="container alt-cta__grid">
      <div class="reveal">
        <h2>Orienter un jeune vers ALTITUDE</h2>
        <p class="alt-cta__lead">Autorités, services, familles : la direction de Jeunesse&Co répond à vos questions, vous rencontre et présente le programme au jeune et à sa famille.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="alt-cta__contact" data-stagger>
        <a class="alt-cta__link" href="mailto:info@jeunesseandco.ch?subject=Programme%20ALTITUDE">
          <span>Écrire</span>
          info@jeunesseandco.ch
        </a>
        <a class="alt-cta__link" href="tel:+41227311947">
          <span>Appeler</span>
          +41 (0)22 731 19 47
        </a>
        <p class="alt-cta__sign">Hacene Debbah, directeur et fondateur · Quai du Seujet 14, 1201 Genève</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

<style lang="scss">
  $ease: cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);

  // ---------- CTA ----------
  .alt-cta {
    background: var(--color-accent);
    color: var(--color-primary);
  }

  .alt-cta__grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 7fr) minmax(0, 5fr);
    gap: 80px;
    align-items: end;

    @media (max-width: 1024px) { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 48px; }

    h2 {
      font-size: var(--fs-xl);
      line-height: 0.98;
      letter-spacing: -0.03em;
      max-width: 17ch;
      text-wrap: balance;
    }
  }

  .alt-cta__lead {
    font-size: var(--fs-md);
    line-height: 1.5;
    max-width: 36em;
    color: var(--color-primary);
  }

  .alt-cta__contact {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 12px;
  }

  .alt-cta__link {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 4px;
    padding: 20px 28px;
    border-radius: 20px;
    background: var(--color-primary);
    color: #F2F0EB;
    font-family: var(--font-headline);
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: var(--fs-md);
    overflow-wrap: anywhere;
    transition: transform 0.4s $ease, box-shadow 0.4s $ease;

    span {
      font-family: var(--font-body);
      font-size: var(--fs-xs);
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.12em;
      color: var(--color-accent);
    }

    &:hover {
      transform: translateY(-3px);
      box-shadow: 0 16px 40px rgba(17, 17, 17, 0.25);
    }
  }

  .alt-cta__sign {
    margin-top: 12px;
    font-size: var(--fs-xs);
    color: rgba(17, 17, 17, 0.75);
  }
</style>
